+<a name="SkCanvas_clipPath"></a>
+## clipPath
+
+<pre style="padding: 1em 1em 1em 1em;width: 50em; background-color: #f0f0f0">
+void clipPath(const SkPath& path, SkClipOp op, bool doAntiAlias)
