+<a href="#Op">Clip Op</a> to apply to <a href="#Clip">Clip</a></td>
+  </tr>  <tr>    <td><a name="SkCanvas_clipPath_doAntiAlias"> <code><strong>doAntiAlias </strong></code> </a></td> <td>
