+  </tr>  <tr>    <td><a name="SkCanvas_drawPosText_paint"> <code><strong>paint </strong></code> </a></td> <td>
+<a href="#SkCanvas_drawPosText_text">text</a> size, blend, color, and so on, used to draw</td>
