+<a name="SkPaint_toString"></a>
+## toString
+
+<pre style="padding: 1em 1em 1em 1em;width: 50em; background-color: #f0f0f0">
+void toString(SkString* str) const;
+</pre>
+
+Converts <a href="#Paint">Paint</a> to machine parsable form in developer mode.
+
