+<a href="#SkPath_lineTo">lineTo</a> appends <a href="#SkPath_kMove_Verb">kMove Verb</a> to <a href="#Verb_Array">Verb Array</a> and (0, 0) to <a href="#Point_Array">Point Array</a>, if needed.
