+<a href="#SkPath_offset">offset</a> from <a href="#Last_Point">Last Point</a> x to <a href="#Conic">Conic</a> end y</td>
+  </tr>  <tr>    <td><a name="SkPath_rConicTo_w"> <code><strong>w </strong></code> </a></td> <td>
