+chooses smaller or larger <a href="#Arc">Arc</a></td>
+  </tr>  <tr>    <td><a name="SkPath_arcTo_4_sweep"> <code><strong>sweep </strong></code> </a></td> <td>
+chooses clockwise or counterclockwise <a href="#Arc">Arc</a></td>
